%% Update lifecycle diagram
flowchart LR
    User([User]) -->|Send message| Telegram
    Telegram -->|Sends update| Backend[Bot Backend]
    Backend -->|Dispatches| Dispatcher
    Dispatcher -->|Routes| Handler
    Handler -->|Executes| AppLogic[App Logic]
    AppLogic -->|Writes| State[State/Persistence]
    AppLogic -->|Calls| BotAPI
    BotAPI -->|Delivers message| Telegram
    Telegram -->|Delivers response| User